# International AI services (first-party only)
# Shared SaaS (Stripe / Auth0 / Sentry / Intercom / captcha / whole googleapis.com) is intentionally omitted.
# GitHub Copilot hosts live in github.list. Discord / Spotify are separate lists.
# Domestic-China AI (DeepSeek / Moonshot / Kimi / Qwen / MiniMax / Zhipu / Doubao / Tongyi / Cici / Dola) omitted.
# Microsoft Copilot on *.microsoft.com stays with 微软服务 (that ruleset loads before AI Suite).
# Not synced from geosite:category-ai-chat-!cn: Envato / ThemeForest, LivePerson, CN brands, ads/telemetry, githubcopilot (github.list).

